# Eight blocks 1024 bytes apart, revisited four times.
#
# The stride is chosen so that every one of them maps to set 0 whatever the
# set count is, which isolates associativity: with fewer than 8 ways they
# evict each other on every pass, and with 8 or more they all fit and only
# the eight compulsory misses remain.
#
#   scripts/sweep-associativity traces/conflict.trace

# pass 1
R 0x0
R 0x400
R 0x800
R 0xc00
R 0x1000
R 0x1400
R 0x1800
R 0x1c00
# pass 2
R 0x0
R 0x400
R 0x800
R 0xc00
R 0x1000
R 0x1400
R 0x1800
R 0x1c00
